femto patch for epub-stream 0.1.0
Subject: stream styled events for any XHTML resource, not only spine items

Add RenderPrep::prepare_resource_with and EpubBook::resource_events, which
take an OPF-relative href instead of a spine index. chapter_events now
resolves the spine item's href and calls resource_events. The resource is
read with the max_entry_bytes hard cap; stylesheets and images resolve
against the resource path.

femto renders manifest-declared XHTML documents that are outside the spine
through the same styled-event path as chapters (docs/dependencies.md).

Independent of 0002 in behaviour; it applies after 0002 only because both
touch neighbouring lines.

